        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_e3394f91",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "哦？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 39,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 40,
        "xlsx_section_index": 19,
        "keywords": [
          "闲趣2（待机动作）"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1b52ec89",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "哎，不着急~你也来一个？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 41,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 42,
        "xlsx_section_index": 20,
        "keywords": [
          "闲趣3（待机动作）"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d723e1b0",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "共鸣医疗科，陆·赫斯。能被你叫来这里——算是难得的例外。叫我陆就好。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 43,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 44,
        "xlsx_section_index": 21,
        "keywords": [
          "自我介绍"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ba26c9b7",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "我已经……与冻土之下的自己诀别。等到雪融时，我们会在崭新的春天里重逢。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 45,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 46,
        "xlsx_section_index": 22,
        "keywords": [
          "初奏"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_26018172",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "嗯，都交给我。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 47,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 48,
        "xlsx_section_index": 23,
        "keywords": [
          "入队1"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_28d1d4af",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "需要医生么？正好我有空。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 49,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 50,
        "xlsx_section_index": 24,
        "keywords": [
          "入队2"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_26de51c6",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但愿这抹金色能成为你最趁手的利刃。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 51,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 52,
        "xlsx_section_index": 25,
        "keywords": [
          "入队3"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_977fc1b7",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "身体在回应……以细微得几乎听不见的频率，就像刀锋被重新打磨的那一瞬。嗯，状态不错，精准，且如臂使指。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 53,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 54,
        "xlsx_section_index": 26,
        "keywords": [
          "突破1"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c8966bd8",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "力量并非只属于厮杀。它也属于那些被囿于崩坏与治愈之间，仍选择继续伸手的人。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 55,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 56,
        "xlsx_section_index": 27,
        "keywords": [
          "突破2"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_428fc222",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……日髓在流动。有点烫，但尚在能够忍受的范畴。没关系，疼痛是医者最熟悉的语言，它在时刻提醒我为何执起这份职责，又该去向何方。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 57,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 58,
        "xlsx_section_index": 28,
        "keywords": [
          "突破3"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0ebcdd4d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "——我不会崩溃的。我是暴雪里的硬骨，是手术台上最烫的那盏灯。我在烧着，但还在稳稳地握住刀。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 59,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 60,
        "xlsx_section_index": 29,
        "keywords": [
          "突破4"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ec7fb6e3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "我们是盟友，要一同将那些不该存于现世的……送回地狱。所以我与你约定，不会背叛，不会离弃，直到我从冰下苏醒，直到日光重新落到这片雪地之上。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 61,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 62,
        "xlsx_section_index": 30,
        "keywords": [
          "突破5"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}